0..77 Comment "//! `tree-state-wp` gives a state weakest-precondition observation over data."
78..81 Comment "//!"
82..162 Comment "//! It represents increment as a tree in the state row. It folds the tree into a"
163..233 Comment "//! type. The normaliser computes a program\'s precondition. The kernel"
234..263 Comment "//! replays each declaration."
264..267 Comment "//!"
268..341 Comment "//! A Dijkstra monad pairs a program with evidence below a specification."
342..420 Comment "//! `incrSpecified` gives evidence at `isOne`. `incrSpecifiedEverywhere` gives"
421..501 Comment "//! evidence at every postcondition. `incrSpecBare` keeps the unpaired evidence."
502..567 Comment "//! `doneSpecified` gives return evidence at every postcondition."
568..571 Comment "//!"
572..634 Comment "//! - see: #2773 — `incrSpecifiedEverywhere`, `incrSpecBare`"
635..671 Comment "//! - see: #2751 — `doneSpecified`"
672..720 Comment "//! - cites: [Maillard-2019-dijkstra_monads_all]"
721..836 Comment "//! [Maillard-2019-dijkstra_monads_all]: https://doi.org/10.1145/3341708 \"Maillard et al., Dijkstra Monads for All\""
838..883 Comment "// The import gives Either, StateOp and Prog."
